<title>USA: Concordia Paper Q1 ADS loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Concordia Paper Q1 ADS loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> ADS loss		    0.45     loss	  2.40</p>
<p> Shr loss		    0.09     loss	  0.48</p>
<p> Loss			 4,268		   21,846</p>
<p> Sales		    206,788		  181,476</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  45,450		   45,450</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Concordia Paper (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Concordia, based in Hong Kong, is the holding company for Concordia Paper Ltd.</p>
<p>Figures in Hong Kong dollars.</p>
<p>Loss and sales figures are consolidated.</p>
<p>ADS means American Depository Shares.  Each ADS represents five ordinary shares.</p>
